00:02:41.021 --> 00:02:46.781
certainly low. Munitions are $29 billion of it. Replacements and repairs are $6.1 billion.

00:02:47.241 --> 00:02:51.281
The Air Force has spent $7.6 billion on squadrons and hundreds of sorties.

00:02:51.701 --> 00:02:56.841
The Army's tab is $2.1 billion for regional bases. The Navy's is $1.5 billion,

00:02:57.161 --> 00:03:02.701
with about 20 ships in the theater at a time. Moving supplies is $92 million. Cyber operations

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:08.761
$14 million. Medical costs $24 million. Elite Commandos $645 million.

00:03:08.761 --> 00:03:11.581
Scentcom says 50,000 troops are involved.

00:03:12.001 --> 00:03:16.421
Many army bases are understood to have taken intense Iranian air strikes, and the times

00:03:16.421 --> 00:03:18.501
found those repair costs were not in this bill.

00:03:19.021 --> 00:03:23.601
A Congressional Research Service report this month said 80 aircraft were lost or damaged.

00:03:24.061 --> 00:03:28.601
The Pentagon said 18 Americans have been killed, and about 860 people injured.

00:03:29.161 --> 00:03:31.981
