00:03:32.641 --> 00:03:36.981
President Volodymyr Zelensky said Ukraine had waited nearly a month for defense secretary

00:03:36.981 --> 00:03:40.561
Pete Hegg-Zeth to sign off on missiles for patriots and nassams.

00:03:41.021 --> 00:03:44.621
In June, the White House and the Pentagon asked Congress for another $70 billion.

00:03:45.401 --> 00:03:49.961
Major strikes are paused while Trump decides whether to resume them after next week's midterms.

00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:55.341
Yahoo reported he told Arali in Lubbock, Texas, the war would end whenever I want it to,

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:59.561
and that he will soon decide whether to make a deal with Iran or finish it off.

00:03:59.981 --> 00:04:04.741
The same report said the New York Times had reported U.S. and Israeli militaries drew up plans

00:04:04.741 --> 00:04:09.901
