00:04:21.493 --> 00:04:26.513
Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, called the spread unprecedented. He warned it could

00:04:26.513 --> 00:04:30.593
reach the United Kingdom and other countries unless more money is secured for preparedness

00:04:30.593 --> 00:04:35.813
and possible treatment. He compared it to COVID, which began in China, then crossed borders,

00:04:36.253 --> 00:04:41.263
killed millions, and tore through health systems and economies. Spain's Toledo province

00:04:41.263 --> 00:04:46.923
lost at least 10 people Wednesday morning when two high-speed trains collided. France 24 reported.

00:04:47.543 --> 00:04:52.403
Esther Padilla, for the Castile La Mancha government, told TVE both trains were going from Madrid

00:04:52.403 --> 00:04:57.363
to Seville, and one hit the tail of the other while it was stopped, knocking two cars off the track.

00:04:57.363 --> 00:05:00.183
She told local media the death toll may rise.

00:05:00.643 --> 00:05:05.463
Rail operator Adif placed the crash between Mora and Orgas on the Madrid-Sovil line

00:05:05.463 --> 00:05:08.223
and stopped Madrid-Andalusia high-speed traffic,

00:05:08.463 --> 00:05:11.423
including Madrid, Ciudad Real and Andalusia.

00:05:11.903 --> 00:05:15.543
A Renfe train and an Iriotrain hit just after 9 in the morning.

00:05:16.423 --> 00:05:21.183
397 passengers were on the Renfe train, 147 on the Iriotrain.

00:05:21.623 --> 00:05:25.523
The regional spokesperson said the cause and the injury count were still being determined.

00:05:25.523 --> 00:05:30.503
The Guardian said State Broadcaster TVE reported a high-speed train ran into the back

00:05:30.503 --> 00:05:32.903
